msgid "Definitions"
msgstr "Définitions"

msgid "Term"
msgstr "Terme"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Signification"

msgid "Inventory entries"
msgstr "Entrées d'inventaire"

msgid "The parsed `hosts` field of an `ansible/inventory` component. See [Components](components.md#hosts)"
msgstr "Le champ `hosts` analysé d'un composant `ansible/inventory`. Voir [Composants](components.md#hosts)"

msgid "Known groups"
msgstr "Groupes connus"

msgid "`all`, `ungrouped`, and every `group` and `children` name in every inventory"
msgstr "`all`, `ungrouped`, et chaque nom de `group` et de `children` de chaque inventaire"

msgid "Addressed hosts"
msgstr "Hôtes adressés"

msgid "Host names that have an `ansible_host` in any inventory"
msgstr "Noms d'hôtes qui ont un `ansible_host` dans un inventaire quelconque"

msgid "Group of a group-vars component"
msgstr "Groupe d'un composant de group vars"

msgid "Its `group` field, else its component name"
msgstr "Son champ `group`, sinon son nom de composant"

msgid "Plays"
msgstr "Plays"

msgid "The parsed `plays` field of an `ansible/playbook` component, else one play from its `hosts` and `roles` fields"
msgstr "Le champ `plays` analysé d'un composant `ansible/playbook`, sinon un seul play issu de ses champs `hosts` et `roles`"

msgid "Play targets"
msgstr "Cibles d'un play"

msgid "The play's `hosts` split on `:` and `,`, trimmed, with a leading `!` or `&` removed, empty parts dropped"
msgstr "Le `hosts` du play découpé sur `:` et `,`, sans espaces autour, sans `!` ou `&` initial, les parties vides étant supprimées"

msgid "Playbook path"
msgstr "Chemin du playbook"

msgid "`<folder>/<name>.yml` with trailing `/` removed from `folder`, or `<name>.yml` when `folder` is empty"
msgstr "`<folder>/<name>.yml` avec le `/` final retiré de `folder`, ou `<name>.yml` lorsque `folder` est vide"

msgid "Vendored roles"
msgstr "Rôles vendorisés"

msgid "Names of `ansible/*` components, other than `inventory`, `group-vars`, `playbook` and `site`, that render more than one file"
msgstr "Noms des composants `ansible/*`, autres que `inventory`, `group-vars`, `playbook` et `site`, qui rendent plus d'un fichier"

msgid "App label"
msgstr "Label app"

msgid "A component's `app` label, else its name"
msgstr "Le label `app` d'un composant, sinon son nom"

msgid "Checks that compare against the inventory ([`gv-group`](#gv-group), [`play-hosts`](#play-hosts)) run only when the project has at least one inventory."
msgstr "Les vérifications qui comparent à l'inventaire ([`gv-group`](#gv-group), [`play-hosts`](#play-hosts)) ne s'exécutent que lorsque le projet contient au moins un inventaire."

msgid "`dup-file`"
msgstr "`dup-file`"

msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Déclencheur"

msgid "Two or more components render a file with the same path"
msgstr "Deux composants ou plus rendent un fichier ayant le même chemin"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titre"

msgid "`<count> components write <file>`"
msgstr "`<count> components write <file>`"

msgid "Detail"
msgstr "Détail"

msgid "`Only the last one survives in the download. Remove or rename one of them.`"
msgstr "`Only the last one survives in the download. Remove or rename one of them.`"

msgid "`cycle`"
msgstr "`cycle`"

msgid "The `children` of an inventory's groups form a cycle. One issue per inventory, for the first cycle found"
msgstr "Les `children` des groupes d'un inventaire forment un cycle. Un problème par inventaire, pour le premier cycle trouvé"

msgid "`Group nesting loops: <a> → <b> → <a>`"
msgstr "`Group nesting loops: <a> → <b> → <a>`"

msgid "`Ansible refuses to load an inventory whose :children form a cycle.`"
msgstr "`Ansible refuses to load an inventory whose :children form a cycle.`"

msgid "`addr`"
msgstr "`addr`"

msgid "A host name appears with two different `ansible_host` values, in one or several inventories"
msgstr "Un nom d'hôte apparaît avec deux valeurs `ansible_host` différentes, dans un ou plusieurs inventaires"

msgid "`<host> has two addresses: <first> and <second>`"
msgstr "`<host> has two addresses: <first> and <second>`"

msgid "`The same host name points at different machines — Ansible uses whichever it reads last.`"
msgstr "`The same host name points at different machines — Ansible uses whichever it reads last.`"

msgid "`empty-child`"
msgstr "`empty-child`"

msgid "A group's `children` names a group that has no `members` and no `children` in the same inventory"
msgstr "Les `children` d'un groupe nomment un groupe qui n'a ni `members` ni `children` dans le même inventaire"

msgid "`[<group>:children] lists \"<child>\", which has no hosts`"
msgstr "`[<group>:children] lists \"<child>\", which has no hosts`"

msgid "`Probably a typo — or add hosts to that group.`"
msgstr "`Probably a typo — or add hosts to that group.`"

msgid "`override`"
msgstr "`override`"

msgid "A host sets `ansible_user` or `ansible_port` to a non-empty value, and its group or an ancestor group sets the same key in `vars` to a different value"
msgstr "Un hôte définit `ansible_user` ou `ansible_port` avec une valeur non vide, et son groupe ou un groupe ancêtre définit la même clé dans `vars` avec une valeur différente"

msgid "`<host> sets <key>=<host value>, overriding [<group>:vars] <key>=<group value>`"
msgstr "`<host> sets <key>=<host value>, overriding [<group>:vars] <key>=<group value>`"

msgid "`Host vars win over group vars. Clear <key> on the host if the group value is the one you want.`"
msgstr "`Host vars win over group vars. Clear <key> on the host if the group value is the one you want.`"

msgid "`gv-layouts`"
msgstr "`gv-layouts`"

msgid "Two or more `ansible/group-vars` components target the same group, whatever their `layout`"
msgstr "Deux composants `ansible/group-vars` ou plus ciblent le même groupe, quel que soit leur `layout`"

msgid "`Group \"<group>\" has both group_vars/<group>.yml and group_vars/<group>/main.yml`"
msgstr "`Group \"<group>\" has both group_vars/<group>.yml and group_vars/<group>/main.yml`"

msgid "`Ansible loads and merges both, so a key set twice depends on load order. Keep one layout.`"
msgstr "`Ansible loads and merges both, so a key set twice depends on load order. Keep one layout.`"

msgid "`gv-group`"
msgstr "`gv-group`"

msgid "A group-vars component's group is not a known group"
msgstr "Le groupe d'un composant de group vars n'est pas un groupe connu"

msgid "`group_vars/<group>.yml targets a group no inventory defines`"
msgstr "`group_vars/<group>.yml targets a group no inventory defines`"

msgid "`Those variables will never be loaded. Check the spelling against your inventory groups.`"
msgstr "`Those variables will never be loaded. Check the spelling against your inventory groups.`"

msgid "`gv-shadow`"
msgstr "`gv-shadow`"

msgid "A key is set both in a group-vars component and in the same group's `vars` in an inventory, unless the group-vars value is present and equal to the inventory value"
msgstr "Une clé est définie à la fois dans un composant de group vars et dans les `vars` du même groupe dans un inventaire, sauf si la valeur des group vars est présente et égale à celle de l'inventaire"

msgid "`<key> is set in both [<group>:vars] and group_vars/<group>.yml`"
msgstr "`<key> is set in both [<group>:vars] and group_vars/<group>.yml`"

msgid "`group_vars/<group>.yml wins (<file value> over <inventory value>). Keep it in one place.` The part in parentheses is omitted when the key has no value in `yaml`"
msgstr "`group_vars/<group>.yml wins (<file value> over <inventory value>). Keep it in one place.` La partie entre parenthèses est omise lorsque la clé n'a pas de valeur dans `yaml`"

msgid "Group-vars keys are read from `yaml` when set, as top-level lines matching `name: value` with surrounding quotes removed from the value; otherwise from `vars`."
msgstr "Les clés des group vars sont lues depuis `yaml` lorsqu'il est défini, sous forme de lignes de premier niveau correspondant à `name: value`, les guillemets entourant la valeur étant retirés ; sinon depuis `vars`."

msgid "`play-hosts`"
msgstr "`play-hosts`"

msgid "A play target is neither a known group nor an addressed host"
msgstr "Une cible de play n'est ni un groupe connu ni un hôte adressé"

msgid "`Play \"<play name>\" targets \"<target>\", which isn't in the inventory`"
msgstr "`Play \"<play name>\" targets \"<target>\", which isn't in the inventory`"

msgid "`The play will match no hosts and silently do nothing.`"
msgstr "`The play will match no hosts and silently do nothing.`"

msgid "`site-missing`"
msgstr "`site-missing`"

msgid "A site component imports a `path` that is not the playbook path of any playbook component"
msgstr "Un composant site importe un `path` qui n'est le chemin d'aucun composant playbook"

msgid "`<site name>.yml imports <path>, which this project doesn't produce`"
msgstr "`<site name>.yml imports <path>, which this project doesn't produce`"

msgid "`Fine if the file already exists in your repo; otherwise add that playbook.`"
msgstr "`Fine if the file already exists in your repo; otherwise add that playbook.`"

msgid "`svc-selector`"
msgstr "`svc-selector`"

msgid "A service's app label matches the app label of no `k8s/deployment` component"
msgstr "Le label app d'un service ne correspond au label app d'aucun composant `k8s/deployment`"

msgid "`Service <name> selects app=<label>, but no deployment has that label`"
msgstr "`Service <name> selects app=<label>, but no deployment has that label`"

msgid "`Its endpoints will be empty. Name the deployment the same, or set the app label.`"
msgstr "`Its endpoints will be empty. Name the deployment the same, or set the app label.`"

msgid "`ing-backend`"
msgstr "`ing-backend`"

msgid "An ingress's `service` field, else its name, is not the name of any `k8s/service` component"
msgstr "Le champ `service` d'un ingress, sinon son nom, n'est le nom d'aucun composant `k8s/service`"

msgid "`Ingress <name> routes to service \"<service>\", which isn't in the project`"
msgstr "`Ingress <name> routes to service \"<service>\", which isn't in the project`"

msgid "none"
msgstr "aucun"

msgid "`multi-inventory`"
msgstr "`multi-inventory`"

msgid "The project has more than one `ansible/inventory` component"
msgstr "Le projet contient plus d'un composant `ansible/inventory`"

msgid "`<count> inventories in this project`"
msgstr "`<count> inventories in this project`"

msgid "`Fine for separate environments; pass the right one with -i. Checks treat their groups as one pool.`"
msgstr "`Fine for separate environments; pass the right one with -i. Checks treat their groups as one pool.`"

msgid "`ext-roles`"
msgstr "`ext-roles`"

msgid "A playbook's plays use roles that are not vendored roles"
msgstr "Les plays d'un playbook utilisent des rôles qui ne sont pas des rôles vendorisés"

msgid "`<playbook name> uses <count> role kikx doesn't vendor`, with `roles` when count is not 1"
msgstr "`<playbook name> uses <count> role kikx doesn't vendor`, avec `roles` lorsque le nombre est différent de 1"

msgid "`<roles> — they must already exist under roles/ in your repo, or scaffold empty ones here.`"
msgstr "`<roles> — they must already exist under roles/ in your repo, or scaffold empty ones here.`"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Action"

msgid "`scaffold-roles` with the list of roles"
msgstr "`scaffold-roles` avec la liste des rôles"

msgid "`not-imported`"
msgstr "`not-imported`"

msgid "The project has at least one site component, and a playbook's path is imported by none of them"
msgstr "Le projet contient au moins un composant site, et le chemin d'un playbook n'est importé par aucun d'eux"

msgid "`<path> isn't imported by any site playbook`"
msgstr "`<path> isn't imported by any site playbook`"

msgid "`It only runs if you call it directly.`"
msgstr "`It only runs if you call it directly.`"

msgid "See also"
msgstr "Voir aussi"

msgid "[Resolve file conflicts and checks](../how-to/resolve-conflicts.md)"
msgstr "[Résoudre les conflits de fichiers et les vérifications](../how-to/resolve-conflicts.md)"

msgid "[Scaffold the roles your playbooks use](../how-to/scaffold-roles.md)"
msgstr "[Générer les rôles utilisés par vos playbooks](../how-to/scaffold-roles.md)"

